<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6345] Wrong message about cluster activation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6345</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Message of an exception that threw while performing an operation on inactive cluster relates to method Ignite.activate(true), which doesn&apos;t exist. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Method in message should be changed to Ignite.active(true)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
